+SCENARIO N: AUTOMATION
+
+1. Create a scheduled workflow in natural language.
+2. Dry-run it.
+3. Confirm each step.
+4. Activate it.
+5. Simulate a failure.
+6. Confirm bounded retry and failure notification.
+7. Pause and resume.
+8. Inspect the run history.
